docs(happy-path): see a result work yourself before handing it to the PO

A greenfield run handed the PO a first result for acceptance that showed only a
black page. The guide now tells the agent, for every kind of result and every
hand-over, to start or open it the way the PO will, look at what it shows, and
say in one line what it saw or why it could not. It is not a gate.

